{"v":4,"catch":"《Smash it Wild》是一款策略回合制遊戲，結合排球與躲避球玩法，締造奇幻宇宙中的熱血比賽。訓練升級球員，在roguelike激戰中打爆對手！","desc":"快來奇幻世界與高手切磋球技，展開你爭我奪的終極競賽。《Smash it Wild》融合排球和躲避球，帶來講究策略的回合制玩法，每次比賽都不容掉以輕心。努力升級球員，裝備強力道具，探索獨特的協力效果，竭盡所能在Roguelike競賽中存活到最後，小心別輸球，否則就必須重新開始。","publisher":"Goblinz Studio","release":"2026-04-16","genres":["策略"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","波蘭文","韓文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.6GB / Switch 0.6GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3bb1b86f3f9b2f70bb9c193af12c2722d708e1a32bf71ca58c93f0aa48bd5926.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1791a300fcb8a28d16160668921611d7373f90493681db7481019bc0af7f4984.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d831736a090b1e3e43ba0916df9ba6ac521457731d2b3933378e73aa9e209a6c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8c44f6bd74443a0e65dffd5f53832377e172076f9e2dafc7931f075d2ed516d2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/946d0cfe6dba920554343f35276ef1f5420e847dcedc075d193fdfb83e5041b2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9a02e488235b3a91619da9af0ed439386e2d9f8f352772da054802c90ffcbb00.jpg"],"titleId":"0100bfb027084000","demo":["70030000024531"],"dlc":[]}